  "Describe what is in the parcel.": {"Türkçe": "Kolinin içinde ne olduğunu yazın.", "Deutsch": "Beschreiben Sie, was im Paket ist.", "Français": "Décrivez le contenu du colis.", "Italiano": "Descrivi il contenuto del collo.", "Español (Spanish)": "Describe qué hay en el bulto.", "Português": "Descreva o conteúdo do volume.", "Русский (Russian)": "Опишите содержимое посылки.", "日本語 (Japanese)": "荷物の中身を記入してください。", "中文 (Chinese)": "请描述包裹内的物品。", "العربية (Arabic)": "صِف محتويات الطرد.", "हिन्दी (Hindi)": "बताएँ कि पार्सल में क्या है।"},
